{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relight Studio</strong> is a powerful photo editing tool that lets you effortlessly manipulate light and atmosphere in your images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Instantly relight your photos and add realistic depth, fog, and ambiance. Go from a flat image to a captivating work of art in just a few clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive, depth\u2011aware relighting of photos using Base + Normal + Depth maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple lights (key/fill/rim) with intuitive joystick controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth Saturation, Depth Exposure, Depth Vignette and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specular intensity and power controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Per\u2011light depth intensity/falloff to shape light over distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depth Fog with color, density, near/far, invert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient Occlusion, bloom, vignette, haze, grade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt\u2011Shift and depth\u2011based exposure/saturation controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean exports at original resolution, with high\u2011quality Normal/Depth resampling</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027790?t=1759997010","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027790?t=1759997010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027790/0ae22177a26dec389800412f8ba33bc2f425be07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759997010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027790/0ae22177a26dec389800412f8ba33bc2f425be07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759997010","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reli